      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Korogocho"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2013, the Austrian‑Kenyan Acakoro Football Academy opened in Korogocho, offering youth a chance to play organized football.",
